
# Northline Barber Co. — Website Demo

A premium, modern barbershop website built as a portfolio project.

## Overview

Northline Barber Co. is a fictional barbershop brand designed to demonstrate a professional small-business website.

The design uses a dark charcoal background, warm gold accents, elegant typography, and a responsive layout.

## Features

- Responsive desktop and mobile layouts
- Mobile navigation menu
- Services and pricing section
- Business introduction section
- Image gallery
- Contact information section
- Smooth scrolling and reveal animations

## Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript
- Google Fonts
- GitHub Pages

## Live Website

[View Northline Barber ohttps://envyy-hub.github.io/Project-001-Barbershop-v2/

## Important Note

This is a fictional demonstration project. Business details, services, and prices are sample content and do not represent an operating barbershop.

